### 0 cli ast one.wtf -q ast | where kind == "document" | select {kind, name, parent, text}
$ wtf ast one.wtf -q ast | where kind == "document" | select {kind, name, parent, text} --root <root> --now 2026-09-18T12:00:00Z
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "kind": "document",
    "name": null,
    "parent": null,
    "text": "# Notes 🦀\r\nPlain prose.\r\n[add] := fn(x) => (\r\n  // keep this comment\r\n  x + missing\r\n)\r\n- [ ] Parent\r\n  - [x] Child @estimate(30m)\r\nSee [add].\r\n```\r\ninert := 5\r\n```\r\n"
  }
]

### 1 cli ast one.wtf -q join(map(filter(ast, fn(n) => n.kind == "line"), fn(n) => n.text), "")
